5030 DATA PIANO,QUEEN,RIVER,STONE,TIGER
5040 DATA UNCLE,VIOLET,WATER,XENON,YOUTH
5050 DATA ZEBRA,BRIDGE,CASTLE,DRAGON,FOREST
5060 DATA GARDEN,HAMMER,ISLAND,JUNGLE,KITTEN
5070 DATA LADDER,MONKEY,NECTAR,ORANGE,PIRATE
5080 DATA ROCKET,SILVER,TEMPLE,UMBRELLA,VALLEY
5090 DATA WINDOW,YELLOW,ANCHOR,BOTTLE,CAMERA
